  "notes": [
    "Input, output and serial dropdowns use 1-based numeric ids (getInputChoices(state, true), src/actions.ts:123 and src/feedback.ts:70); id 1 is the first port. The module subtracts 1 when talking to the device.",
    "The dropdowns have no allowInvalidValues; whether Companion accepts expressions for the numeric ids is handled by the generic expression rule for API 2.x modules (not tested against a running instance).",
    "Port counts and labels depend on the connected Videohub model; the catalog therefore lists the choices as dynamic."
